#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/mvm.rst:38
msgid "Legacy Requirements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/mvm.rst:40
msgid "**Operating System:** Ubuntu 22.04"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/mvm.rst:41
msgid "**CPU:** One or more 64-bit x86 CPUs with Intel VT or AMD-V enabled"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/mvm.rst:42
msgid "**Memory:** 4 GB minimum, plus 4 GB per Ceph disk for converged layouts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/mvm.rst:43
msgid ""
"**Storage:** A data disk of at least 500 GB for test HCI deployments; "
"production requires additional capacity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/mvm.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Networking:** Static Host IP addresses, DNS resolution of the "
"|morpheus| appliance, and access to package repositories"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/mvm.rst:45
msgid "**Cluster Size:** At least three Hosts for an HCI layout"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/mvm.rst:47
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/mvm.rst:47
msgid ""
"Ubuntu 22.04 uses Netplan. Configure static Host networking before "
"provisioning the cluster. Clustered storage and combined traffic "
"configurations require at least 10 Gbps interfaces with jumbo frames "
"enabled end-to-end."
msgstr ""

